    <h1 class="text-6xl heading-serif mt-3">About St. Edward the Confessor</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-lg mt-8 text-stone-700">
      <p>St. Edward the Confessor Catholic Church has served the faithful of Tallulah and the surrounding communities for many years. We are a welcoming parish dedicated to the celebration of the sacraments, prayer, and service to our neighbors.</p>
      
      <p>Named after St. Edward the Confessor, King of England and patron saint of kings and difficult marriages, our parish continues his legacy of faith and devotion in northeast Louisiana.</p>
